      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/palo-blanco-tx-zavala-county",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1909, the Palo Blanco Baptist Church was organized at the Williams Ranch with help from local pioneers.",
